{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26525","headline":"山出云 · 张胜之","name":"山出云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片云初出岫，孤迥色难亲。\n盖小辞山近，根轻触石新。\n飘颻经绿野，明丽照晴春。\n拂树疑舒叶，临流似结鳞。\n从龙方有感，捧日岂无因。\n看取爲霖去，恩沾雨露均。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张胜之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}